<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Genesis Health reinstated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Genesis Health reinstated.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said analyst Lucy Olwell reinstated coverage of Genesis Health Ventures Inc with a strong buy rating.</p>
<p>-- The firm set earnings per share estimates on the geriatric care provider of $1.39 for calendar 1996 and $1.75 for 1997.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 1-3/8 to 26-1/8.</p>
